&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 24px; text-align: left"&gt;発行価格        1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 24px; text-align: left"&gt;資本組入額      1&lt;/p&gt;
